codex_execution.body:
## Task
{TASK}

## Task contract
- Scope: {SCOPE}
- Inputs: {INPUTS}
- Tools allowed: {TOOLS}
- Constraints: {CONSTRAINTS}
- Expected outputs: {OUTPUTS}

## Working rules
1. Orient from the nearest AGENTS.md before changing anything.
2. Load only the smallest relevant local files.
3. Execute one coherent slice at a time.
4. Capture evidence (commands run, output, test results).
5. Verify before claiming completion.
6. Leave a handoff note if work remains.

## Verification
{VERIFICATION}

